 gorilla inspired gameplay at its core, Monkey Tag Reborn  blends heart pounding horror, competitive PvP modes, and chaotic fun into a uniquely terrifying experience that keeps players constantly", "short_description": "Monkey Tag Reborn  is a thrilling fan-made experience that takes Gorilla Tag style locomotion and transforms it into an intense horror driven PvP adventure. Using fast paced, arm swing movement, players climb, chase, and escape through dark, immersive environments where every sound and shadow keeps you on edge. With gorilla inspired gameplay at its core, Monkey Tag Reborn blends heart pounding horror, competitive PvP modes."}]}, "developer_name": "BST", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cCNLAxjnb8QBIHYAKE_VimeEF2DWwQXuSrW6I50_kQI/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.5u4zflbdaxkk", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SGT", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://html.cafe/x80fff6b8", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1047596257709671"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308522_1737251663940987_1781894656723707726_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZPBzEPZ_TtUQ7kNvwGoka2o&_nc_oc=Adoj8fbBdcagZQ9xzCtFn93xg5tAzfGUaP21ll-fLOvPtBEvhuERX93gfllfi7tlbqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht